    # Phase 3: G := E * F
    #   E ∈ R^{ni×nj}, F ∈ R^{nj×nl}, G ∈ R^{ni×nl}
    #   G[i, l] = sum_j E[i, j] * F[j, l]
    #
    # Tiled GEMM over (i, l, j). For each (I, L) tile of G we:
    #   - zero the tile once,
